  xd: log(L'CI/L850): N 137; within-L_IR-bin SD real 0.236; shuffled-partner (300 shuffles, seed 2386) mean 0.471 (2.5-97.5%: 0.426-0.507); fully random partner 0.868; ratio real/shuffled 0.50
