  [PASS] H-C8b ad real/shuffled 0.52 < 0.8
  toy w=0.25: max |mass_a - mass_b| 0.0e+00; relative drift 0.20 per unit x in tracer a -> factor-a slope -0.0500 (expect -0.0500), factor-b slope +0.1500 (expect +0.1500); common-mode 0.30/x on both: factor slopes +3.5e-17, -1.1e-16; mass slopes +0.300
  toy w=0.5: max |mass_a - mass_b| 0.0e+00; relative drift 0.20 per unit x in tracer a -> factor-a slope -0.1000 (expect -0.1000), factor-b slope +0.1000 (expect +0.1000); common-mode 0.30/x on both: factor slopes +2.5e-17, -2.5e-17; mass slopes +0.300
  toy w=0.75: max |mass_a - mass_b| 0.0e+00; relative drift 0.20 per unit x in tracer a -> factor-a slope -0.1500 (expect -0.1500), factor-b slope +0.0500 (expect +0.0500); common-mode 0.30/x on both: factor slopes -1.4e-16, +4.7e-17; mass slopes +0.300
[PASS] C6 toy optimiser: masses agree to <1e-12 for any input; a relative drift d appears as -w d and (1-w) d; a common-mode drift shifts the masses but not the factors

